<title>USA: Xytronyx PTM Kit gets final FDA approval.</title>
<headline>Xytronyx PTM Kit gets final FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xytronyx Inc said on Tuesday in a statement that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration gave final approval for the commercial sales and distribution of the Periodontal Tissue Monitor (PTM Kit).</p>
<p>The PTM Kit is a chairside test for the detection and monitoring of periodontitis, a form of periodontal disease.</p>
<p>H. Laurence Shaw, president and chief executive officer at Xytronyx, said he sees international sales of the PTM Kit through Steri-Oss Inc in the United States, Hawe-Neos Dental in Europe and Shofu Inc in Japan.</p>
<p>Xytronyx Inc is a licensing, research and development company for healthcare products.</p>
</text>
